=== note on x01 (all three runtimes: EntryPointNotFoundException)
x01 declared pinvokeimpl("msvcrt") '__p__environ', which x64 msvcrt.dll does not export (it exports the data symbol _environ);
the failure is the experiment's, and the kind of error the resolver reports at link time. data-win.il replaced it.
